WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.152
Meet FindBox.

2
00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:04.718
We give everyday belongings a way home.

3
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:09.197
Smart labels connect families to a private, school-supported return system.

4
00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:12.877
For parents, that means less searching and clearer updates.

5
00:00:12.877 --> 00:00:18.549
For schools, one workspace brings students, collection points, and verified handovers together.

6
00:00:18.549 --> 00:00:23.271
From a missing bottle to a happy reunion, FindBox keeps your community connected.

7
00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:25.435
FindBox dot Africa.

8
00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:27.322
A little less lost.

9
00:00:27.322 --> 00:00:29.093
A lot more found.
